---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Privacy Policy - FERS Retirement Calculator";
const description =
  "How the FERS Retirement Calculator handles data: calculator inputs stay in your browser, no accounts, plus Google Analytics and Cloudflare hosting.";
const updated = "2026-09-10";

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  name: title,
  description: description,
  url: "https://www.fers-retirement-calculator.com/privacy/",
  inLanguage: "en",
  dateModified: updated,
};
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical="https://www.fers-retirement-calculator.com/privacy/"
  schema={schema}
  updatedTime={updated}
>
  <section class="hero-sheen border-b border-line bg-surface">
    <div class="page-shell py-14 sm:py-16">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-balance text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Last updated: {updated}
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad">
    <div class="page-shell max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">The short version</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        The calculator itself collects nothing. Every number you enter is processed in your browser and never sent to us or
        anyone else. Like most websites, this site uses aggregate analytics and standard web hosting infrastructure, described
        below.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">Calculator inputs</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Your High-3 salary, years of service, birth year, survivor benefit election, and all other calculator inputs are used
        locally to compute estimates on your device. They are not transmitted to our servers, not stored in any database, and not
        included in analytics. Downloaded estimate reports are generated in your browser as a local file.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">Analytics</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        This site uses Google Analytics to understand aggregate usage — which pages are visited and how long visitors stay. Google
        Analytics sets cookies (such as the _ga cookie) and collects data such as your IP address, browser type, and pages viewed.
        We do not use this data to identify individual visitors, and calculator inputs are excluded. You can prevent analytics
        tracking by using your browser's private browsing mode, blocking cookies, or installing Google's opt-out browser add-on.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">Hosting and logs</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        The site is served through Cloudflare, which processes standard request data (IP address, user agent, requested URL) to
        deliver content and protect against abuse. Request logs are retained by the hosting provider under its own policies and
        are not used to profile visitors.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">No accounts, no emails</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        There are no user accounts on this site. We do not ask for your name, email address, or any personal information in order
        to use the calculator. If you email us, we use your message only to respond and improve the site.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">External links</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        The site links to official resources such as OPM, the Social Security Administration, and the Thrift Savings Plan. We are
        not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites; review their policies separately.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">Changes and contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Material changes to this policy will be reflected in the last updated date above. Questions about this policy can be sent
        to <a href="mailto:hello@fers-retirement-calculator.com" class="font-semibold text-primary hover:underline">hello@fers-retirement-calculator.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
